    "Maketto (H Street)": "Erik Bruner-Yang's Cambodian-Taiwanese cafe famous for cumin-glazed twice-fried wings dusted with crushed peanuts, a refined bar snack turned full meal.",
    "DCity Smokehouse (Bloomingdale)": "Black-owned barbecue spot whose smoked wings have crackly, salty-sweet skin and come with cilantro ranch plus a beloved Carolina-mumbo sauce blend.",
