    "The Green Zone (Adams Morgan)": "Middle Eastern cocktail bar pouring acclaimed drinks alongside crispy halal Arabic-spiced wings seasoned with lemon, za'atar, sumac, and garlic.",
    "Oohh's & Aahh's (U Street)": "Longtime U Street soul food carryout whose fried wings come in buffalo, teriyaki, lemon pepper, or mumbo-style barbecue, often as a full platter with sides.",
    "Upstate FTW (U Street)": "Syracuse-rooted sports bar serving what many call DC's most authentic Buffalo wings, crispy and vinegar-buttery across three heat levels."
